libwireshark 4.2.6 is GPL-2.0-or-later. src/ws_capture.c adapts the epan and
wiretap lifecycle from the dbshark program in the attached reference archive
sqlshark-cursor-jsonb-promotion-races-94e7.zip (src/dbshark.c). PostgreSQL
ingestion from that program is not included. scripts/build-wireshark-4.2.6.sh,
scripts/deps-debian.sh, and scripts/deps-rhel.sh are adapted from
tests/dbshark/build in the same archive.
